{
  "lineCounts": {
    "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}": 6,
    "Player": 20,
    "「绿松石」": 1,
    "派蒙": 49,
    "玻娜": 48
  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7513601",
      "subQuestName": "探索天蛇船",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "751360101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "751360101": {
            "id": "751360101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "呼…总算是活、活下来了，脚踏实地的感觉真好…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751360102"
            ]
          },
          "751360102": {
            "id": "751360102",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "你明明一直是飘着的吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751360103"
            ]
          },
          "751360103": {
            "id": "751360103",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "喂，就算是这么说，飘在地面上和在天空上被大风刮得乱转还是有很大区别的吧！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751360104"
            ]
          },
          "751360104": {
            "id": "751360104",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "这里看着也不太结实。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751360105"
            ]
          },
          "751360105": {
            "id": "751360105",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "#欸？你别吓我啊，一会要是真的掉下去的话，我一个人可拉不动你跟{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}两个！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751360106"
            ]
          },
          "751360106": {
            "id": "751360106",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "「绿松石」",
            "text": "叽咕…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751360107"
            ]
          },
          "751360107": {
            "id": "751360107",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "那就是天蛇船吗？我们成功啦！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751360108"
            ]
          },
          "751360108": {
            "id": "751360108",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "呀！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751360109"
            ]
          },
          "751360109": {
            "id": "751360109",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "虽然与其说船还不如说是个大毛线球！看起来缠缠绕绕的，倒确实很像蛇呢。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751360110"
            ]
          },
          "751360110": {
            "id": "751360110",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "我们想办法去到那边吧，至少那里看上去要比这边安全一些…唔，也不知道玻娜去了哪里…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751360111"
            ]
          },
          "751360111": {
            "id": "751360111",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "虽然她说自己的飞行经验很丰富啦，不过还是有点担心…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751360112"
            ]
          },
          "751360112": {
            "id": "751360112",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "只要风向没错的话…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751360113"
            ]
          },
          "751360113": {
            "id": "751360113",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "唔，你说的也有道理，如果风向没错的话，她一定也会落到这附近的。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751360114"
            ]
          },
          "751360114": {
            "id": "751360114",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "留在这里也没有答案。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751360115"
            ]
          },
          "751360115": {
            "id": "751360115",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "唔，你说的也有道理，在这里担心也没有什么用处，说不定她现在已经在天蛇船上面等我们了呢。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751360116"
            ]
          },
          "751360116": {
            "id": "751360116",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "那我们就先过去吧！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7513602",
      "subQuestName": "探索天蛇船",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "751360201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "751360201": {
            "id": "751360201",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "这是什么啦？虽然看起来造型和火磷石差不多，但是会发光还不停往外冒火，感觉比玻娜的火磷石厉害多了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751360202"
            ]
          },
          "751360202": {
            "id": "751360202",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "该不会说，这才是火磷石原本的样子？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751360203"
            ]
          },
          "751360203": {
            "id": "751360203",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "好烫！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751360204"
            ]
          },
          "751360204": {
            "id": "751360204",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "#哇，{NICKNAME}，你不要看到什么宝贝就伸手去拿啦。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751360205"
            ]
          },
          "751360205": {
            "id": "751360205",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "不知不觉就…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751360206"
            ]
          },
          "751360206": {
            "id": "751360206",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "派蒙没资格说我吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751360207"
            ]
          },
          "751360207": {
            "id": "751360207",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "呀！呀！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751360208"
            ]
          },
          "751360208": {
            "id": "751360208",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "#嗯？{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}对这个有什么头绪吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751360209"
            ]
          },
          "751360209": {
            "id": "751360209",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "#哇，{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}好厉害，看这样子说不定终于到了你大显身手的地方了呢。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751360210"
            ]
          },
          "751360210": {
            "id": "751360210",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "#接下来要是再发现什么烫烫的宝物，就都可以拜托{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}了！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751360211"
            ]
          },
          "751360211": {
            "id": "751360211",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "噫，呀！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751360212"
            ]
          },
          "751360212": {
            "id": "751360212",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "玻娜",
            "text": "喂！呀嚯，这里这里！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751360213"
            ]
          },
          "751360213": {
            "id": "751360213",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "哇，那不是玻娜吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751360214"
            ]
          },
          "751360214": {
            "id": "751360214",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "不过她怎么会在那里啦，该不会是直接落到了那…总之我们先过去和她会合吧！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7513603",
      "subQuestName": "探索天蛇船",
      "sceneId": null,
